WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:04.070
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, this week on
Orphan Black Doctor Leekie and Sarah both

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.750
dropped
huge bombs about the original cloning experiment.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:10.910
A bunch of people seem like they’re changing
their allegiances and we got to see some very

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.950
pretty dirty sexy Rachel.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:16.070
If you’re finding me for the first time
I usually do weekly Orphan Black videos, be

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.070
sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:23.290
I missed last week so there’s no episode
4 video but feel free to leave questions about

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:26.240
anything from the last couple of episodes
in the comments.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.240
So where do we start.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.870
This episode was filled with a lot of WTF
moments that made me laugh a little.

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:32.480
I’m not sure what you’d call that.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:34.780
But here are my top 5.

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:38.740
Careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen
it yet.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:42.079
Number 5 - Paul Becomes Rachel’s New Daniel

00:00:42.079 --> 00:00:44.220
Turns out that’s a pretty demanding job.

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:48.530
I love the power dynamic in all of Rachel’s
relationships, not just the sexual relationships.

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:51.830
It’s like any room she walks in to she just
dominates.

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:54.650
Unless she’s with Sarah and then there’s
always this weird vibe.

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:57.420
Just because I think Rachel is a little afraid
of her.

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.130
Maybe of Helena too.

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:02.820
It really seemed like Rachel was having fun
trying to take Sarah’s toy.

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:04.489
Toy being Paul.

00:01:04.489 --> 00:01:05.970
Maybe that’s just a sister joke.

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:09.860
It’s fun to watch her be petty since she’s
always so hard to read.

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:13.270
I couldn’t really tell what Paul’s motivations
in all this are.

00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:16.900
It seems like he’s going to the darkside
and Rachel is the Emperor.

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:21.240
In all fairness, if the Emperor in Star Wars
looked like Rachel, there would have been

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:24.560
a lot more people trying to join the Sith.

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:27.200
Number 4 - Paul Incriminates Felix To Blackmail
Sarah

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:32.960
I loved how this went from really sweet, to
funny, to scary so fast.

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:37.630
Felix gets his crazy date night montage with
Colin and the one thing he promised wouldn’t

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:41.100
happen happens and the police burst in.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:44.740
Just as Colin squeezes like the entire tube
out on his hand.

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:46.040
The look on his face was priceless.

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.270
What this, this is nothing.

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:53.660
And then for just a minute I really thought
Rachel had sent Paul to kill Felix.

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:55.200
But it’s all about blackmailing Sarah.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:58.340
It hasn’t worked yet, so as of the end of
the episode.

00:01:58.340 --> 00:01:59.710
Felix is rotting in jail.

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:01.750
That whole sequence of events was so crazy
you could really pick any one of the moments

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:09.009
out as a favorite, but the actors talked about
how hard it was for them to film the gun scene.

00:02:09.009 --> 00:02:13.050
Let me know if you think Paul really would
kill Felix or one of the other non-clone friends.

00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:16.480
I don’t think Rachel would kill any of the
core clones.

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:20.670
It was kind of implied that he killed some
people for her in Taiwan.

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:25.730
It’s hard to tell when Rachel was looking
at him when she first told him she was taking

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:26.730
him along.

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:30.400
I thought she either took him for security
or sex.

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.569
Or both.

00:02:31.569 --> 00:02:34.430
I really do like the way Rachel is blurring
the lines with Paul.

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:39.640
It’s funny when they invoke Daniel in their
dirty pretty sexy time.

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:44.470
Number 3 - Doctor Leekie Likes Beer
I’m so happy with the way allegiances are

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:45.470
changing.

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:49.129
Leekie is best buds with clone club or anything,
but he is making them a deal.

00:02:49.129 --> 00:02:52.390
At the end of the day I think he just wants
to push his project forward and he’s willing

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:55.610
to help Sarah and the Clones if it means they
can recover lost data.

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:59.290
There was so much information that got dropped
in Cosima’s scenes.

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:04.629
Leekie is searching for the synthetic DNA
inside the clones that’s keeping them alive.

00:03:04.629 --> 00:03:08.790
My guess is that they won’t be able to cure
whatever is making Cosima sick until they

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:12.310
find Rachel’s Father and get whatever Data
he has.

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:17.230
I’m also totally expecting Leekie to double
cross clone club again.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:20.819
If he’s lying to Rachel to help Cosima,
then why wouldn’t he just turn around and

00:03:20.819 --> 00:03:22.600
lie to Cosima at some point.

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:26.750
Let me know if you think he’ll keep helping
them after he gets what he needs.

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:28.040
That will be the test.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.840
Number 2 - The Creator Is Still Alive

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:32.060
One of their creators that is.

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:36.430
But it looks like Swan Man, Rachel’s father
is alive and hiding out somewhere.

00:03:36.430 --> 00:03:39.500
Helena is like the world’s best bloodhound.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:43.000
If the pacing of the last couple of episodes
holds up, they’ll probably find him in the

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:44.340
next 1 or 2 episodes.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:48.740
Basically all the hard data is supposed to
have been lost in the fire.

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:55.200
The original genome they developed to grow
the clones.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:04:00.170
So they can’t grow more or fix the clones
that are breaking down, until they learn more

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:01.170
about it.

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:04.160
And right now it seems like Swan Man is the
only one who can help.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:06.819
I’m wondering how Mrs S is connected to
him too.

00:04:06.819 --> 00:04:09.900
She’s in her 50s and Swan Man is supposed
to be in his 70s.

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:14.950
So maybe she was just like a lab tech or an
intern working with them.

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:17.069
Or she was related to one of them.

00:04:17.069 --> 00:04:21.900
But I love that were getting so much new information
about the original cloning experiment.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:25.220
It’s like they’re teasing a prequel show
for when Orphan Black goes off the air.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:30.469
It would be like baby Clone Club set in the
70s.

00:04:30.469 --> 00:04:33.439
and my Number 1 moment - Sarah Stops Helena
from Killing Rachel

00:04:33.439 --> 00:04:37.449
I actually thought this moment was more intense
than Felix with the gun.

00:04:37.449 --> 00:04:40.979
Mostly because Sarah stepped in front of the
sniper rifle while she was trying to talk

00:04:40.979 --> 00:04:43.000
Helena down.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:45.360
All while Rachel was mauling Paul.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:46.710
She’s so fascinating.

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:52.020
It’s like she’s using weird sex as a way
to let her emotions out.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:58.169
And Paul is like a new race horse she’s
thinking about buying, so she just inspects

00:04:58.169 --> 00:04:59.259
him like an animal.

00:04:59.259 --> 00:05:02.409
That was pretty epic as far as sex scenes
go.

00:05:02.409 --> 00:05:04.479
How amazing was Helena too.

00:05:04.479 --> 00:05:06.949
She was by far my favorite Clone this week.

00:05:06.949 --> 00:05:09.990
I can’t get Pretty, Dirty, Sexy out of my
head.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:10.990
And that doll.

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:17.250
All of that was why I laughed so hard when
Sarah threatened Leekie at the bar later.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.710
I love the dynamic between Helena and Sarah.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:23.830
It’s like they’re a separate two-member
Clone Club inside the larger Clone Club because

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:25.121
they were born as twins.

00:05:25.121 --> 00:05:28.460
Helena acknowledges she has other seestra’s,
but I think Sarah is the only one she’s

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:31.969
bonded to.

00:05:31.969 --> 00:05:35.159
But now it’s your turn, let me know what
your favorite moment was.

00:05:35.159 --> 00:05:37.300
And which sex scene did you think was the
funniest.

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:42.009
I don’t mean intentionally funny, I just
mean the one you laughed at the most.

00:05:42.009 --> 00:05:43.999
Overall the episode was a solid B plus.

00:05:43.999 --> 00:05:48.289
I always get excited when the writers flip
a bunch of the relationships on the show.

00:05:48.289 --> 00:05:52.819
Leekie helping the clones, Paul letting himself
get dominated by Rachel.

00:05:52.819 --> 00:05:56.130
Like I said, my favorite clone this week was
Helena.

00:05:56.130 --> 00:06:00.139
Rachel was fascinating, but this week Helena
was like a black hole for my attention.

00:06:00.139 --> 00:06:03.069
Just so strong I couldn’t think about anything
else when she was around.

00:06:03.069 --> 00:06:07.249
You really do forget sometimes that Tatiana
Maslany is playing them all.

00:06:07.249 --> 00:06:12.289
There’s only so many times you can say she’s
amazing until we all just accept it as something

00:06:12.289 --> 00:06:17.090
that will always be the same.

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:22.759
Of all the characters right now I feel like
Felix and Paul are the weakest, Felix gets

00:06:22.759 --> 00:06:28.030
physically dominated for comedy a lot, but
Paul is like a Robot that Sarah and Rachel

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:29.360
are controlling.

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:33.139
I think Paul thinks he’s doing everything
for the greater good.

00:06:33.139 --> 00:06:35.939
But really at the end of the day he has no
will of his own.

00:06:35.939 --> 00:06:38.539
He’s just an appendage of Rachel’s now.

00:06:38.539 --> 00:06:41.689
An appendage she likes to have sex with in
really strange ways.

00:06:41.689 --> 00:06:47.069
I can’t wait till we get an extended scene
with Rachel and Helena though.

00:06:47.069 --> 00:06:48.909
They’re like the two heavy hitters on the
show right now.

00:06:48.909 --> 00:06:50.349
Not to forget any of the other important plot
points.

00:06:50.349 --> 00:06:52.939
Some of these are interesting and some are
just horrifying.

00:06:52.939 --> 00:06:54.889
First Gracie in the torture closet.

00:06:54.889 --> 00:06:58.020
She is not going to walk away from this season
with all her marbles.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:01.539
The Proletheans are just way too crazy to
let anyone stay sane.

00:07:01.539 --> 00:07:05.699
Most importantly, she’s probably going to
end up having to carry that creepy baby.

00:07:05.699 --> 00:07:09.080
As nuts as she is, how can you not feel bad
for her.

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:20.649
Kira and Cal are adorable together, but we
keep seeing Kira’s supernatural qualities

00:07:20.649 --> 00:07:22.379
manifest, like she’s playing a different
game from everyone else.

00:07:22.379 --> 00:07:24.599
She’s so self aware it’s unsettling.

00:07:24.599 --> 00:07:28.869
Like when Cal is making jokes about socks
and she’s scanning money, passports and

00:07:28.869 --> 00:07:29.869
guns.

00:07:29.869 --> 00:07:32.679
And then there’s Cosima’s sickness she’s
been hiding from the rest of the Clones.

00:07:32.679 --> 00:07:36.879
Sarah understands what’s going on but with
Allison in rehab it seems like Clone Club

00:07:36.879 --> 00:07:39.270
is slowly coming apart at the seams.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:43.090
I’m really excited to find out what the
Place of Screams is next week though.

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:50.259
I have a wedding I have to go to but I’m
still going to be doing a few bonus videos

00:07:50.259 --> 00:07:51.259
next weekend.

00:07:51.259 --> 00:07:54.189
I’ll try to get Orphan Black up too.

00:07:54.189 --> 00:07:55.959
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:07:55.959 --> 00:07:59.249
I’ll be posting updates on social.

